 0.0000000000 12.0000000000 0.0000000000
 0.0000000000 0.0000000000 12.0000000000
ATOMIC_POSITIONS bohr
 O 6.0625000000 6.0625000000 4.9215778523
 O 6.0625000000 6.0625000000 7.2034221477
K_POINTS automatic
 1 1 1 0 0 0
